Package: massdataset
Title: Data Structures and Core Utilities for MS Data
Version: 0.99.3
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Xiaotao",
           family = "Shen",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "xiaotao.shen@outlook.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9608-9964"))
Description: Provides a structured data container for MS experiments,
    with a focus on small-molecule profiling workflows. The package
    includes core utilities for storing, accessing, combining,
    summarizing, and converting rectangular MS datasets in a consistent
    format for use across the 'tidymass' ecosystem.
biocViews: Software, DataImport, DataRepresentation, Visualization, 
           MassSpectrometry, Metabolomics, Lipidomics, QualityControl, 
           Preprocessing, StatisticalMethod, Infrastructure
